Package: owntone
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, avahi-daemon
Description: DAAP/DACP, MPD and RSP media server with AirPlay support
 OwnTone is an iTunes-compatible (DAAP/DACP), MPD and RSP (Roku) media
 server. It supports AirPlay devices, Chromecast, Apple Remote and
 compatibles, MPD clients, internet radio, Spotify and LastFM.
